		{
			"id": 4008309,
			"completionStepIds": [
				4008309
			],
			"beginWay": "TALK_BEGIN_MANUAL",
			"beginConditions": {
				"logic": "LOGIC_NONE",
				"conditions": [
					{
						"type": "QUEST_COND_STATE_EQUAL",
						"rawParams": [
							"4008309",
							"2"
						],
						"stepId": 4008309,
						"stateName": "QUEST_STATE_UNFINISHED"
					}
				]
			},
			"mark": "TALK_MARK_NONE",
			"trigger": {
				"objectNames": [
					"Dori"
				],
				"points": []
			},
			"dialogs": [
				{
					"id": 400830901,
					"content": "Layla's note says that this is where we should be meeting the Almighty Merchant...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						400830902
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 400830902,
					"content": "The looks on your faces tell me you're searching for the Almighty Merchant, yes? Welcome, welcome!",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						400830903
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Dori"
				},
				{
					"id": 400830903,
					"content": "Yeah! How did you know?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						400830904
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 400830904,
					"content": "Wait, Dori? Ah, so you're the Almighty Merchant Layla mentioned?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						400830905
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 400830905,
					"content": "Why so surprised? Every vendor and customer in the Grand Bazaar knows that Lord Sangemah Bay possesses the widest and most magical range of goods.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						400830906
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Dori"
				},
				{
					"id": 400830906,
					"content": "\"Almighty,\" \"supreme,\" \"omnipotent\"... These and many more are my exclusive epithets. Any other merchant thinking of using one can forget it... unless they're prepared to pay millions of Mora in licensing fees!",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						400830907
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Dori"
				},
				{
					"id": 400830907,
					"content": "Huh, guess Paimon should've known...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						400830908
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 400830908,
					"content": "Yeah yeah, whatever, but back to business. I'm surprised that Layla sent you here on her behalf... I suppose she must be busy enjoying the beast-tamers tournament, hmm?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						400830909
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Dori"
				},
				{
					"id": 400830909,
					"content": "Sounds like you two get along pretty well. You know a lot about what's going on!",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						400830910
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 400830910,
					"content": "Hehe, it has nothing to do with getting along. Layla previously bought a few things from me. They weren't the most valuable goods, but it was still a lot of Mora — for a student.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						400830911
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Dori"
				},
				{
					"id": 400830911,
					"content": "So naturally, I now keep tabs on her activity. Which is why I know that she's taking part in a very suspicious tournament!",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						400830912,
						400830913
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Dori"
				},
				{
					"id": 400830912,
					"content": "So you know something about what's going on.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						400830914
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 400830914,
					"content": "Mm-hmm. Something just didn't feel right. As it happens, I do have some goods I'm trying to get off my hands — they're a little hot for my liking, but so far, no takers... They're also taking up space. So I think I'll just give them to you.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						400830915
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Dori"
				},
				{
					"id": 400830915,
					"content": "Umm... This is just a bunch of spare parts and random notes...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						400830916
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 400830916,
					"content": "I'm told that this is a device and some documents that the organizer attempted to destroy.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						400830917
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Dori"
				},
				{
					"id": 400830917,
					"content": "But they were careless. Some people will scavenge through anything hoping for a chance to get rich. Sure enough, someone fished these out of the water and sent them to me.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						400830918
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Dori"
				},
				{
					"id": 400830918,
					"content": "Now that Paimon takes a closer look, this looks similar to the recipe for Floral Jelly. And these parts look like they came from a Wisdom Orb.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						400830919
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 400830919,
					"content": "Maybe they were used during the experiment phase? Let's hold onto them for now and have Miko take a look later. Maybe she'll notice if there's anything fishy about them.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						400830920,
						400830921
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 400830920,
					"content": "I think we can safely assume that...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						400830922
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 400830922,
					"content": "Yeah, seems like our worries were well-placed after all... But Paimon still wants to hang out with Bongo-Head...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						400830923
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 400830923,
					"content": "I don't know what you two are talking about, but it sounds like these items might prove useful to you. Tell you what — I'll give you a discount! 60 million Mora, thank you for your business!",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						400830924
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Dori"
				},
				{
					"id": 400830924,
					"content": "Huh!? Why, you sneaky little...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						400830925
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 400830925,
					"content": "Hehehe, I'm just kidding! No one gives a hoot about these items except for you and the matra. We have other business to do today. Consider this a little extra I'm throwing in to sweeten the deal.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						400830926
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Dori"
				},
				{
					"id": 400830926,
					"content": "Show me Layla's list. I just need to know what she wants. Once I've finished stocking up the goods, I'll send someone to deliver them to her so that you don't have to.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						400830927
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Dori"
				},
				{
					"id": 400830927,
					"content": "That's a relief! Paimon thought all our efforts were gonna go down the drain... We couldn't afford that price even if we won the top prize...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						400830928
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 400830928,
					"content": "Here's Layla's order list.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						400830929
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 400830929,
					"content": "Hmm... flour mixed with Matsutake powder, vintage Jam, Zaytun Peach Juice... Is this really the Fungi diet? How did Layla even find that out...?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [],
					"speakerTitle": "Dori"
				},
				{
					"id": 400830921,
					"content": "There's something suspicious about Kautilya...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						400830922
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 400830913,
					"content": "Do you have any intel?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						400830914
					]
				}
			]
		},
		{
			"id": 4008313,
			"completionStepIds": [
				4008313
			],
			"beginWay": "TALK_BEGIN_MANUAL",
			"beginConditions": {
				"logic": "LOGIC_NONE",
				"conditions": [
					{
						"type": "QUEST_COND_STATE_EQUAL",
