					],
					"speakerTitle": "Souka"
				},
				{
					"id": 400831703,
					"content": "Oh no, did we go too far? Souka's taking this pretty hard... Miko said it was fine to not hold back, but she'll definitely be mad at us when she sees her in this state...",
